WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.270
For instance,
even if those arms of yours

00:04.270 --> 00:07.100
Become entwined in chains

00:07.100 --> 00:10.540
For instance,
even if this space we live in

00:10.540 --> 00:14.910
Someday will burn completely down

00:14.910 --> 00:21.040
Keep believing in hope, if nothing else

00:22.320 --> 00:26.580
In the shadows of glimmering stars

00:28.390 --> 00:32.660
There is a world governed by darkness

00:34.460 --> 00:38.960
Just one life that is out there

00:40.470 --> 00:45.740
If you keep it entrapped there,
lonely boy

00:46.540 --> 00:52.310
The reason that we met each other here

00:52.310 --> 00:58.650
Must surely exist

00:58.650 --> 01:01.920
For instance,
even if sorrow takes you

01:01.920 --> 01:04.860
And you're about to collapse under it

01:04.860 --> 01:08.200
For instance,
if my chest can become

01:08.200 --> 01:12.570
A power to hold you and keep you there

01:12.570 --> 01:16.970
I'm sure that even
tomorrow we can survive

01:28.320 --> 01:30.750
This... and this...

01:33.120 --> 01:34.920
Oh, I need this, too.

01:34.920 --> 01:35.910
Hey...

01:37.230 --> 01:38.290
Oh, I'm sorry.

01:38.290 --> 01:39.560
That's heavy, huh?

01:39.560 --> 01:43.300
I-It's not that this
is heavy or anything...

01:43.300 --> 01:44.970
That's just like you, Mr. Alien.

01:44.970 --> 01:46.670
You're so reliable.

01:46.670 --> 01:48.070
Then take this too.

01:49.170 --> 01:51.540
What are you two doing all alone?

01:52.540 --> 01:56.310
N-Nothing really.

01:57.680 --> 01:59.380
You look suspicious.

01:59.380 --> 02:01.580
It has nothing to do with you, Paiway.

02:01.580 --> 02:02.740
Don't bother me.

02:06.420 --> 02:08.890
You know what day it is today, right?

02:10.060 --> 02:11.430
Today?

02:11.430 --> 02:12.760
What day was it?

02:14.930 --> 02:15.920
Fine!

02:17.770 --> 02:19.390
What is that creature?

02:22.600 --> 02:24.370
I see it. I see it.

02:25.810 --> 02:28.380
How long I've dreamed of this day...

02:28.380 --> 02:31.110
The fact that you can see
it with that telescope...

02:31.110 --> 02:33.980
How far are we along on our way back?

02:33.980 --> 02:38.390
Well, to put it in a nutshell,
about halfway I'd say.

02:38.390 --> 02:40.320
I believe our message to home

02:40.320 --> 02:42.190
should be there by now as well.

02:42.190 --> 02:46.090
But maybe the "harvest" is done

02:46.090 --> 02:48.260
and everyone's already dead!

02:50.730 --> 02:53.260
Wait, that's not a good joke.

02:54.300 --> 02:58.260
Well, I didn't have
that deep a meaning...

03:19.590 --> 03:22.230
It's been months since we
started living on this ship.

03:22.230 --> 03:24.630
I've been worried about
my standings here lately.

03:24.630 --> 03:26.830
In other words,
how they're treating me.

03:26.830 --> 03:29.200
They still treat me like
a stranger on the bridge.

03:29.200 --> 03:32.300
I can't help but feel they're
taking advantage of me.

03:33.310 --> 03:34.370
What do you think?

03:36.380 --> 03:37.510
Are you listening?

03:37.510 --> 03:38.950
No, I'm not.

03:38.950 --> 03:40.520
Just as I thought...

03:40.520 --> 03:41.750
Hey, wait!

03:41.750 --> 03:44.120
I'm seriously worried here!

03:44.120 --> 03:46.390
I can't even sleep at night!

03:46.390 --> 03:48.390
There's a story that goes like this.

03:48.390 --> 03:52.460
There was a man who started
working where men had long hair.

03:52.460 --> 03:57.270
When he joined, his hair was short,
and everyone avoided him.

03:57.270 --> 04:00.940
However, when the
man's hair grew long enough,

04:00.940 --> 04:04.230
he had blended in and made
friends before he realized it.

04:05.240 --> 04:07.140
I see.

04:17.850 --> 04:20.450
How is everyone doing today?

04:24.560 --> 04:26.390
Why are you laughing?

04:26.390 --> 04:29.930
All I'm trying to do
is bridge the gap between us!

04:29.930 --> 04:32.490
Now, look at me!

04:51.850 --> 04:52.840
What?

04:56.120 --> 04:58.250
Mr. Alien, hurry up!

05:00.330 --> 05:01.730
I know!

05:01.730 --> 05:03.860
Geez, you're so annoying.

05:04.870 --> 05:06.330
I'll go on ahead!

05:07.300 --> 05:08.270
What's that?

05:24.250 --> 05:26.020
I have to hurry!

05:26.020 --> 05:28.390
Paiway's already caught onto me!

05:28.390 --> 05:31.360
Oh, Mr. Alien,
grab that bowl over there!

05:31.360 --> 05:32.350
I refuse!

05:33.800 --> 05:36.400
I'm not your servant!

05:36.400 --> 05:38.970
What are you so mad about today?

05:38.970 --> 05:41.300
That apron really looks good on you!

05:41.300 --> 05:43.290
Idiot, that's not the problem.

05:44.570 --> 05:46.410
Oh well...

05:46.410 --> 05:47.910
If you helped me

05:47.910 --> 05:51.580
I would've let you have
some delicious hamburger steak.

05:51.580 --> 05:53.070
It's a shame.

05:55.120 --> 05:56.110
Here.

05:57.290 --> 05:58.270
Thanks!

06:00.290 --> 06:02.620
Geez, why me?

06:02.620 --> 06:03.610
Hey, this...

06:04.930 --> 06:05.890
Y-You...

06:07.360 --> 06:08.350
What?

06:09.700 --> 06:11.070
It's nothing.

06:11.070 --> 06:12.900
It can't be nothing!

06:12.900 --> 06:14.800
Why are you crying?

06:14.800 --> 06:15.900
Huh?

06:15.900 --> 06:17.000
It's all right!

06:17.000 --> 06:18.340
Leave me alone!

06:18.340 --> 06:20.380
What's wrong?
You're making me worry!

06:20.380 --> 06:22.080
Pai-check.

06:22.080 --> 06:25.180
I can't take it anymore!

06:25.180 --> 06:27.180
You finally took that thing off?

06:27.180 --> 06:29.050
You look better like that.

06:29.050 --> 06:32.820
Are all of you going to
keep those men on the loose?

06:32.820 --> 06:35.860
A man was peeping into my room just now!

06:35.860 --> 06:37.090
You're kidding!

06:37.090 --> 06:41.530
I wore this in the first place
to avoid contact with men.

06:41.530 --> 06:45.500
I can't stand breathing the
same air as men anymore!

06:45.500 --> 06:46.490
Poor girl...

06:47.640 --> 06:49.130
Hey, everyone look at this!

06:50.100 --> 06:52.940
It's documentary footage I just got!

06:52.940 --> 06:55.430
Look at the violent
man who makes Dita cry!

06:57.450 --> 07:01.150
We've recently forgotten
something very important.

07:01.150 --> 07:04.720
That's... the fact
that men are dangerous!

07:04.720 --> 07:07.480
If you were watching,
why didn't you help her?

07:09.060 --> 07:13.060
B-But Dita said that the guy
was more important than me...

07:13.060 --> 07:14.460
How horrible!

07:14.460 --> 07:17.360
We got along so well
before those men came!

07:18.400 --> 07:22.840
And today's the anniversary
of Paiway joining our crew!

07:22.840 --> 07:24.340
- I can't forgive them!
- That jerk!

07:24.340 --> 07:25.830
No, it's all guys!

07:26.770 --> 07:28.110
Y-Yeah.

07:29.110 --> 07:31.370
I don't like what Dita's doing.

07:32.480 --> 07:34.140
I'll leave the punishment to you.

07:36.180 --> 07:37.320
Me?

07:37.320 --> 07:38.290
What?

07:38.290 --> 07:39.920
You're serious?

07:39.920 --> 07:41.620
I wonder why...

07:41.620 --> 07:43.930
It seems like the time's finally here.

07:43.930 --> 07:44.890
What is it?

07:44.890 --> 07:46.420
It's been so noisy lately.

07:48.500 --> 07:50.830
Hibiki made Dita cry.

07:52.330 --> 07:54.340
Just that?

07:54.340 --> 07:56.570
That has nothing to
do with your duties.

07:56.570 --> 07:57.970
Return to your stations.

07:57.970 --> 07:59.010
That's right!

07:59.010 --> 08:00.610
Men are at fault!

08:00.610 --> 08:04.350
We were all happy
together before they came!

08:04.350 --> 08:07.180
Dita has really changed a lot lately.

08:07.180 --> 08:08.380
Yeah, yeah.

08:08.380 --> 08:11.620
It's just "Mr. Alien this,
Mr. Alien that" these days.

08:11.620 --> 08:14.620
Maybe she caught some
virus from the men?

08:14.620 --> 08:19.160
It's true that we should
rethink how we treat the men.

08:19.160 --> 08:21.160
We should inform the captain.

08:21.160 --> 08:22.360
How stupid.

08:22.360 --> 08:26.230
Recklessly follow your emotions
and you won't get anywhere.

08:26.230 --> 08:27.800
That's right!

08:27.800 --> 08:30.870
Leader, are you going
to side with the men?

08:30.870 --> 08:33.370
Don't make a big deal
over something stupid.

08:33.370 --> 08:35.840
What do you mean, "something stupid"?

08:38.580 --> 08:41.850
Um, let's all be friends...

08:41.850 --> 08:44.920
Are people making that big a deal?

08:44.920 --> 08:48.560
So much that you shouldn't
leave them alone.

08:48.560 --> 08:50.730
It's not a major problem.

08:50.730 --> 08:52.390
Our home planet is right ahead.

08:52.390 --> 08:54.860
We should concentrate
on getting back now.

08:54.860 --> 09:01.170
But there's a possibility that the
people of Mejale won't believe us.

09:01.170 --> 09:04.770
After all, it's information from us.

09:04.770 --> 09:08.540
Then are you going to watch our
planet be exterminated, Captain?

09:08.540 --> 09:09.530
BC.

09:10.710 --> 09:12.250
I apologize.

09:12.250 --> 09:14.280
I did it! It's done! I'm done!

09:14.280 --> 09:17.850
I'm sure Paiway will be
happy when she sees this!

09:17.850 --> 09:20.150
Hamburger steaks are amazing.

09:21.490 --> 09:22.690
Girls?

09:22.690 --> 09:25.930
Dita, you're forbidden from
talking to men anymore.

09:25.930 --> 09:28.500
W-What are you saying?

09:28.500 --> 09:31.470
You think men are more
important than your friends!

09:31.470 --> 09:32.960
You traitor!

09:34.200 --> 09:37.610
We forbid all men, from
now on, from talking to Dita.

09:37.610 --> 09:39.010
What's this about?

09:39.010 --> 09:42.640
Don't act dumb! You made Dita cry!

09:42.640 --> 09:43.680
That's not true!

09:43.680 --> 09:46.850
I was crying because
I was chopping onions!

09:46.850 --> 09:49.120
It's not Mr. Alien's fault!

09:49.120 --> 09:51.350
Tears do come out
when you chop onions...

09:51.350 --> 09:52.350
Shut up!

09:52.350 --> 09:53.720
Why?

09:53.720 --> 09:56.320
Everyone's gone crazy
since you came along.

09:56.320 --> 10:00.230
That's right! Men are
all violent and disgusting!

10:00.230 --> 10:02.160
What the hell are you talking about?

10:02.160 --> 10:03.330
Stop messing around!

10:03.330 --> 10:06.770
Why... Why?

10:06.770 --> 10:11.500
All I wanted to do was
surprise Paiway a little bit...

10:15.710 --> 10:17.680
There's no use talking.

10:17.680 --> 10:20.150
- We're bringing him down by force!
- Yes!

10:20.150 --> 10:22.280
Now, stay still!

10:22.280 --> 10:24.550
You guys are being so damned selfish!

10:25.550 --> 10:27.150
I can't take it anymore!

10:29.520 --> 10:30.860
Out of my way!

10:30.860 --> 10:32.560
Mr. Alien!

10:32.560 --> 10:33.990
- After him!
- Yes, ma'am!

10:36.000 --> 10:36.990
Wait, girls!

10:48.810 --> 10:50.140
You quack!

10:50.140 --> 10:51.810
This is amusing.

10:51.810 --> 10:53.550
You're the one who suggested this!

10:53.550 --> 10:56.120
That if my hair was long,
I'd be able to fit in!

10:56.120 --> 11:00.110
I merely meant that it takes
time to get along with others.

11:04.290 --> 11:05.890
Laugh if you want to!

11:05.890 --> 11:07.630
It's better than being a nuisance!

11:07.630 --> 11:08.600
What was that?

11:08.600 --> 11:10.400
You want to get beat up?

11:10.400 --> 11:12.530
You're still so violent...

11:12.530 --> 11:15.340
That's why the women don't like you!

11:15.340 --> 11:17.100
I'll take you on, bastard!

11:17.100 --> 11:18.700
- Oh, there he is!
- Damn it!

11:22.840 --> 11:24.110
Over there! After him!

11:24.110 --> 11:27.240
We've decided to
hold you under custody.

11:33.950 --> 11:34.990
It's a Vanguard!

11:34.990 --> 11:36.660
Our prisoner has escaped!

11:36.660 --> 11:38.530
Hibiki, what are you doing?

11:38.530 --> 11:42.760
I don't want to go back
to that hellhole ever again!

11:42.760 --> 11:44.090
See ya!

11:47.670 --> 11:49.470
What's everyone doing?

11:49.470 --> 11:51.410
We don't have time for this.

11:51.410 --> 11:52.370
Leader!

11:53.340 --> 11:54.570
Where's Mr. Alien?

11:56.980 --> 11:58.070
It can't be...

11:59.850 --> 12:01.180
Mr. Alien...

12:08.860 --> 12:11.260
Geez, what the hell did I do?

12:14.400 --> 12:15.730
Damn it all...

12:34.280 --> 12:35.270
Damn you!

12:36.820 --> 12:38.320
Hurry up with the ID!

12:38.320 --> 12:40.550
Captain, we don't
have data on that ship!

12:43.460 --> 12:46.090
Damn it, are you picking a fight?

12:46.090 --> 12:48.890
I can still do something
even though I can't combine!

12:49.930 --> 12:51.030
Who are you?

12:51.030 --> 12:52.760
Why are you in this area?

12:53.970 --> 12:55.170
I just came here.

12:55.170 --> 12:56.740
Got a problem with that?

12:56.740 --> 12:57.770
Where are you from?

12:57.770 --> 12:59.570
Tarak! What about it?

13:01.410 --> 13:02.470
Tarak...

13:06.350 --> 13:08.370
That little one sure gives us problems.

13:09.850 --> 13:11.250
Captain!

13:11.250 --> 13:14.120
If given permission,
I will go look for him.

13:25.930 --> 13:30.910
What are you guys staring at
me with those pale faces for?

13:30.910 --> 13:33.900
Yeah, I'll take on any
of you whenever you want!

13:39.210 --> 13:41.380
Sorry to have been so rough.

13:41.380 --> 13:42.550
Forgive us.

13:42.550 --> 13:45.690
We're desperate to avoid
being harvested as well.

13:45.690 --> 13:48.420
I'm sure your planet is
facing the same thing, right?

13:48.420 --> 13:50.860
But rather than just
waiting to be harvested,

13:50.860 --> 13:55.500
we're fighting till the end and
putting up a line of defense here.

13:55.500 --> 13:57.360
A line of defense?

13:57.360 --> 14:00.030
Being so defensive is a mistake!

14:00.030 --> 14:02.830
I'd get them before they get me!

14:17.590 --> 14:19.050
You come first.

14:20.450 --> 14:22.920
Come on, show me your arm.

14:22.920 --> 14:25.630
W-What are you doing?

14:25.630 --> 14:26.690
It's all right.

14:26.690 --> 14:28.590
Just leave it to me, okay?

14:34.170 --> 14:37.910
I'm Seran, a mechanic on this ship.

14:37.910 --> 14:39.270
What's your name?

14:39.270 --> 14:41.610
M-M-Me?

14:41.610 --> 14:43.510
"A courageous guest."

14:43.510 --> 14:44.500
Just kidding!

15:06.330 --> 15:07.390
Here you go!

15:09.840 --> 15:12.860
Oh? No word of thanks?

15:18.010 --> 15:19.840
T-Thanks...

15:21.320 --> 15:22.520
You're welcome.

15:22.520 --> 15:24.450
Mr. Pilot.

15:24.450 --> 15:26.220
Is the wound on your arm all right?

15:26.220 --> 15:27.390
Leader.

15:27.390 --> 15:29.720
This isn't anything.

15:29.720 --> 15:31.730
Sorry for the trouble.

15:31.730 --> 15:34.760
We'll take care of the broken
parts on the mecha as well.

15:34.760 --> 15:36.030
I'll help out.

15:36.030 --> 15:39.170
I know the most about my partner.

15:39.170 --> 15:40.070
That's true.

15:40.070 --> 15:41.870
Then before that...

15:41.870 --> 15:43.770
Let's take a little break.

15:43.770 --> 15:46.370
Here, this is a special drink I made.

15:46.370 --> 15:47.360
Try some.

15:49.380 --> 15:51.910
Well, don't hesitate to have some.

15:51.910 --> 15:54.780
Though I won't guarantee
that it tastes good.

15:54.780 --> 15:56.020
Geez...

15:56.020 --> 15:58.110
You have to have some too, Leader.

16:00.120 --> 16:01.260
You know...

16:01.260 --> 16:03.420
Are you two, you know,

16:03.420 --> 16:05.450
always together?

16:06.690 --> 16:08.200
What do you mean?

16:08.200 --> 16:10.800
W-Well, I mean...

16:10.800 --> 16:13.730
We've always been together since birth.

16:13.730 --> 16:15.730
And we always will be.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.810
What the hell is this?

16:23.810 --> 16:25.980
It's filled with Vitamins B and C.

16:25.980 --> 16:27.410
It's good for your skin!

16:27.410 --> 16:28.380
Skin?

16:30.350 --> 16:32.790
The enemy is after our skin.

16:33.990 --> 16:34.980
Skin...

16:39.330 --> 16:40.730
They're finally here.

16:57.850 --> 16:59.850
W-What the hell is this?

16:59.850 --> 17:02.320
I've never seen
something this huge before!

17:02.320 --> 17:05.320
It's an enemy flagship.
A tough opponent.

17:05.320 --> 17:08.120
You guys were fighting
something this huge?

17:08.120 --> 17:10.820
If we don't fight, we get harvested.

17:10.820 --> 17:14.020
We won't give up on
life until the very end.

17:16.400 --> 17:17.490
Start cannon fire!

17:22.100 --> 17:23.840
We'll stop them here!

17:23.840 --> 17:26.370
Don't let them get even
one step closer to our planet!

17:26.370 --> 17:27.310
Roger!

17:50.960 --> 17:53.060
Shit! Don't let it near the main deck!

17:59.140 --> 18:00.740
They're concentrating
on the starboard side!

18:00.740 --> 18:02.110
The shield won't last!

18:02.110 --> 18:04.700
Enemy cubes have entered Block 4!

18:10.720 --> 18:11.690
Done on my end!

18:11.690 --> 18:12.650
I'll go too!

18:12.650 --> 18:15.320
Wait, I'm almost done here, too.

18:15.320 --> 18:17.950
I will repair this one.

18:21.700 --> 18:23.930
All right! Done!

18:23.930 --> 18:25.200
Sorry for keeping you.

18:25.200 --> 18:26.930
You're all ready for launch.

18:28.270 --> 18:29.640
Do your best!

18:29.640 --> 18:31.470
Yeah, leave it to me!

18:37.810 --> 18:38.800
Seran?

18:43.350 --> 18:44.340
Seran!

18:45.720 --> 18:47.240
Hey, are you all right?

18:48.420 --> 18:50.460
Come on, hang on!

18:50.460 --> 18:51.450
Hey!

18:52.990 --> 18:54.550
E-Everyone...

18:56.400 --> 19:00.660
Is everyone... all right?

19:03.640 --> 19:04.930
Hey, you! You're kidding, right?

19:05.940 --> 19:07.200
Tell me it's a joke!

19:08.210 --> 19:09.680
Hey, Seran...

19:19.820 --> 19:20.810
We can't lose!

19:24.260 --> 19:25.290
Don't falter!

19:25.290 --> 19:27.090
We need to show
them what we're made of!

19:32.530 --> 19:38.060
Do they all die that easily?

19:48.080 --> 19:50.050
Why?

19:58.960 --> 20:01.430
Come on, who's next?

20:03.830 --> 20:05.090
That boy...

20:06.330 --> 20:08.490
Everyone, follow that boy!

20:18.610 --> 20:19.600
What?

20:26.120 --> 20:27.050
Look out!

20:35.130 --> 20:37.530
W-Why...

20:41.130 --> 20:44.040
Each and every one of you is a bastard!

21:02.060 --> 21:03.520
Mr. Alien...

21:32.150 --> 21:37.760
Hey, you realized what the words,

21:37.760 --> 21:43.260
I really wanted to hear are, right?

21:43.260 --> 21:49.500
I was looking at your profile as
you talked about the distant future.

21:49.500 --> 21:59.810
Take me with you to the depths of dreams.

21:59.810 --> 22:02.350
Hey, with all of my body.

22:02.350 --> 22:14.130
A pistol named love shoots
through the center of my chest.

22:14.130 --> 22:25.740
Negotiations and common
sense hold no meaning at all.

22:25.740 --> 22:37.550
Pull the trigger named love and
shoot through my frozen heart.

22:37.550 --> 22:51.420
Pour in your love
to the tips of my fingers.
